                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.00/2187: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chargé in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Merrell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-01-15T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 15,
                                1926—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>2. For General Russell. Your telegram No. 2, January 7, noon. Secretary of the
                    Navy has issued orders for withdrawal of vessels from immediate vicinity of
                    Haiti.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
